Develop registration and login APIs.

Registration (POST /auth/register) — validates input, checks for duplicate email/phone, hashes password with bcrypt, creates user, returns JWT
Login (POST /auth/login) — validates input, checks credentials, blocks deactivated accounts, returns JWT, records last login
Protected route (GET /auth/me) — verifies JWT via Passport strategy, returns current user
Password hashing, JWT generation, input validation, error handling, controller/service separation, Prisma integration, env vars — all in place, all confirmed against your partner's actual schema and existing files


Fully built (savings plan feature):

Create a goal - auto-calculates required contribution per period
List all your goals
View one goal in detail - includes contribution history + progress percentage
Record a contribution - updates currentAmount, recalculates plan, auto-completes goal if target hit
List contributions for a goal
Everything behind JWT auth, ownership-checked (no cross-user access), atomic writes where it matters (the transaction in contributions)



## Notifications Module

Handles sending notifications to users and scheduling automated savings reminders.

### Features
- Centralized notification service that respects user notification preferences
  (email/push toggles from `UserSettings`)
- All sent notifications are logged to the database for audit/history (`NotificationLog`)
- Automated daily reminder job that checks users with active savings goals and
  sends reminders based on each user's preferred frequency (daily/weekly/monthly)
- Reminder logic prevents duplicate sends — a user won't be reminded again until
  their chosen frequency interval has passed
- Manual trigger endpoint for testing/verifying the reminder logic on demand

### Endpoints
| Method | Route                              | Auth required | Description                                      |
|--------|-------------------------------------|---------------|---------------------------------------------------|
| GET    | `/notifications/health`             | No            | Health check                                       |
| GET    | `/notifications`                    | Yes (JWT)     | List the current user's notification history       |
| POST   | `/notifications/trigger-reminders`  | No            | Manually runs the reminder check (for testing)      |

### Scheduled Job
- Runs automatically every day at 9:00 AM
- Evaluates all active users with at least one active goal
- Sends a reminder summarizing required contributions per active goal

### Known limitations
- Actual delivery (email/SMS/push) is not yet integrated with a provider —
  notifications are currently logged and recorded in the database only
- Notifications are only triggered by the scheduled reminder job so far;
  other events (e.g. goal completion, successful contribution) do not yet
  send notifications
- Not yet tested against a live database — logic is implemented and compiles
  cleanly, but end-to-end execution is unverified